OL,3,GNEWSAMG Alba boss says Gaelic media
OL,4,Aservices lack funding
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe chairman of MG Alba has told MPs
OL,7,Fthat Gaelic media services have missed
OL,8,Fout on "serious" public funding.
OL,10,FMG Alba services include the
OL,11,FLearnGaelic website and it works with
OL,12,Fthe BBC to deliver Gaelic language
OL,13,Fservice BBC Alba.
OL,15,FJohn Morrison told the Scottish Affairs
OL,16,FCommittee's inquiry into the future of
OL,17,FGaelic broadcasting that Welsh and
OL,18,FIrish services receive "millions of
OL,19,Fpounds" to help them diversify.
