OL,3,GNEWSAMG Alba boss says Gaelic media
OL,4,Aservices lack funding
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Scottish government, which provided
OL,7,F#15m to MG Alba for 2026-27, said the
OL,8,Forganisation did not benefit from "fair
OL,9,Ffunding" direct from the TV licence
OL,10,Ffee.
